  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 200 * 13 * 9 * 200 * 25 = 75 \n\nOption 1) +, ×, −, ÷\n\nMathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ 200 + 13 × 9 - __**200 ÷ 25**__ = 75\n\n⇒ 200 + __**13 **____**× **____**9**__ - 8 = 75\n\n⇒ __**200 + 117**__ - 8 = 75\n\n⇒__** **____**317 - 8**__ = 75\n\n⇒ 309 ≠ 75\n\nOption 2) ÷, −, ×, +\n\nMathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ __**200 ÷ 13**__ - 9 × 200 + 25 = 75\n\n⇒ 15.3 - __**9 × 200**__ + 25 = 75\n\n⇒ __**15.3**__ - 1800 __**+ 25**__ = 75\n\n⇒ __**40.3 - 1800**__ = 75\n\n⇒ -1759.7 ≠ 75 \n\nOption 3) ×, ÷, +, −\n\nMathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ 200 × __**13 ÷ 9 **__+ 200 - 25 = 75 \n\n⇒ __**200 **____**× 1.4**__ + 200 - 25 = 75 \n\n⇒ __**280**____** + 200**__ - 25 = 75 \n\n⇒ **__480__****__ - 25__** = 75 \n\n⇒ 455 ≠ 75 \n\n**Option 4) −, ×, −, ÷**\n\nMathematical signs to sequentially replace the * signs then:\n\n⇒ 200 - 13 × 9 - __**200 ÷ 25**__ = 75 \n\n⇒ 200 - **__13 __****__×__****__ 9__** - 8 = 75 \n\n⇒ 200 __**- 117**____** - 8**__ = 75 \n\n⇒ __**200 - 125**__ = 75 \n\n⇒ 75 = 75 \n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**−, ×, −, ÷**\".",
